abstract: >-
  TAP-721 (proposal name; number 721 requested), a flagship TapeOut standard for Netlist-Bound NFTs,
  plus three extension TAPs (bridging between TapeOut chains, Proof-of-Design attributes, and a
  structural hash of flat netlists), with Python reference implementations, test vectors, Foundry
  contracts and tools. Submitted to TapeOutProtocol/TAPs on 2026-10-18 (Idea issue #66, PRs #67-#70;
  reference implementation pinned at commit e4b9229). Draft; not deployed; reviewed internally only,
  not externally audited.
